The LOT® BioStation™ is a rugged weather station delivered in monthly modular kits via a subscription model. Over a 12-month build cycle, the user (targeted at young fathers) receives a new sensor each month alongside everyday household essentials (such as toothbrushes, soaps, socks, or cookware). The subscription tiers range from $99 to $399 per month.
